# GitHub delivery

- After completing and validating a requested code or documentation change, commit the related files and push the commit to the configured `origin` remote.
- Use `https://github.com/CarToon890/dropscan-project.git` as `origin`.
- Pull or fetch first when the remote may have newer work. Preserve remote history and resolve divergence without force-pushing.
- Do not commit build output, test artifacts, local history, tokens, PINs, receiver IPs, or other machine-specific data.
- Report the commit hash and push result in the final response.
